==== hyperbricks yaml {!{images}} ====
images:
  - type: images
  - height: "100"
  - directory: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/
==== explainer ====
Output height in integer pixels. Omit one dimension to preserve the aspect ratio; percentages belong in CSS.
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGES>",
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "Height": 100,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 0,
  "Directory": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/",
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 0
}

==== expected output ====
<img src="/static/images/cute_cat_cf6e86a5019b7eff32b5cae8e570c67d_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="" />
<img src="/static/images/same_cute_cat_cf6e86a5019b7eff32b5cae8e570c67d_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="" />
